      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Personal first-reply writer for each new lead in a sheet\nWrites a short, personal first reply for every lead row that does not have one yet, so you only review and send.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0d524df1-e705-5a87-9a05-107f5e331017",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Use a Google Sheet with a tab named **Leads** and these headers in row 1 (see `sheet-headers.csv`).\n2. Fill the input columns (name, message). Leave reply_draft empty: the AI fills it.\n3. Open **Settings**: sheet URL and how many rows to process per run.\n4. Connect Google Sheets and OpenAI on the nodes with warnings.\n5. Run once by hand, check the results, then switch to **Active**. It only touches rows where reply_draft is empty.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "be4facfe-54dc-541f-ab86-efaa5df78ee3",
      "name": "Note: setup",
